<![CDATA[<font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Hello {!Opportunity.OwnerFullName},<br><br>An Opportunity with your name on it has changed stages.<br><br>Account Name: {!Opportunity.Account}</font><div style=""><font face="arial" style=""><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Physical Address State: </span>{!Opportunity.Physical_Address_State__c}</font><br><font face="arial" style="font-size: small;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Opportunity Name: {!Opportunity.Name}</span></font><br><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">{!Opportunity.Link}</span></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br>New Stage:&nbsp; <span style="font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;">{!Opportunity.StageName}</span><br><br><font size="2">Sincerely,<br>Salesforce Automation</font><br></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
